605
45:43.602 --> 45:45.011
Second.

606
45:45.011 --> 45:47.634
Because I've fallen for you.

607
45:47.634 --> 45:48.806
What?

608
45:48.806 --> 45:51.239
Is this his way of confessing?

609
45:51.239 --> 45:52.352
No.

610
45:52.352 --> 45:54.008
There's still one more.

611
45:54.008 --> 45:57.152
Hear the man out before you jump to conclusions.

612
45:57.152 --> 45:58.191
