621
46:28.851 --> 46:32.299
Must be nice having so much free time!

622
46:32.299 --> 46:36.092
That's the first time anyone's called me idle.

623
46:39.455 --> 46:41.302
See you again.

624
46:45.028 --> 46:46.548
