642
47:27.773 --> 47:29.312
"Taeyun Group?"

643
47:29.312 --> 47:30.351
Yeah.

644
47:30.351 --> 47:32.454
She's still an intern,

645
47:32.454 --> 47:34.126
but it's been a month already.

646
47:35.738 --> 47:37.025
