650
47:44.630 --> 47:46.822
At Taeyun Group, of all places?

651
47:48.009 --> 47:50.117
Okay, I'll call you later.

652
47:50.117 --> 47:51.118
Bye.

653
47:55.850 --> 47:59.556
She has a job, but she's going to interviews?

654
48:00.690 --> 48:03.301
Our background check shows Lee Eun Chae is

655
48:03.301 --> 48:07.338
