656
48:07.338 --> 48:08.783
Understood.

657
48:12.950 --> 48:15.158
Lee Eun Chae...

658
48:15.158 --> 48:17.545
What's your story?

659
48:17.545 --> 48:19.373
Yes, sir.

660
48:19.373 --> 48:21.709
Could you repeat that?

661
48:21.709 --> 48:24.754
I bought a car seat,

662
48:24.754 --> 48:27.667
and I want to know if fart smells stick to it.

663
48:28.618 --> 48:31.698
What kind of question is that?

664
48:33.571 --> 48:37.517
You're asking if the seat traps the smell of farts?

665
48:37.517 --> 48:39.011
I need to know

666
48:39.011 --> 48:41.808
whether I can fart while driving

667
48:41.808 --> 48:43.564
before I decide.

668
48:43.564 --> 48:47.614
If you're worried about the smell, don't fart!

669
48:47.614 --> 48:49.138
May I have your name?

670
48:49.138 --> 48:52.754
I'll check whether your car seat has odor-resistant features.

671
48:52.754 --> 48:54.186
Let me check.

672
48:54.186 --> 48:56.452
My name?

673
48:56.452 --> 48:58.370
Kim Bait.

674
48:58.370 --> 49:00.370
"Kim Bait?"

675
49:00.370 --> 49:01.415
Now, tell me,

676
49:01.415 --> 49:04.502
would you fart or hold it in?

677
49:04.502 --> 49:05.586
Is that Kim Bait?

678
49:05.586 --> 49:07.380
I can't find your name.

679
49:07.380 --> 49:08.606
I'm asking you!

680
49:08.606 --> 49:11.180
Fart or hold it in?

681
49:13.094 --> 49:14.704
Kim Bait?

682
49:16.339 --> 49:19.406
I took the bait.

683
49:19.406 --> 49:20.768
Sir,

684
49:20.768 --> 49:23.605
you can't make prank calls here.

685
49:23.605 --> 49:26.178
You fall for it every time.

686
49:27.893 --> 49:29.694
It's him!

687
49:29.694 --> 49:33.800
The guy who asked why his cereal didn't make him strong like a tiger

688
49:33.800 --> 49:35.806
and wouldn't let it go.

689
49:38.532 --> 49:42.837
Can't you go one day without causing trouble?

690
49:42.837 --> 49:44.444
You called the cops?

691
49:44.444 --> 49:47.128
What are we supposed to do with you?

692
49:47.128 --> 49:49.797
He's a serial prank caller.

693
49:49.797 --> 49:52.508
That's why I reported him.

694
49:52.508 --> 49:55.254
The emergency line isn't for reporting prank calls.

695
49:55.254 --> 49:59.400
So you basically made a prank call yourself!

696
49:59.400 --> 50:03.294
If you keep causing trouble, find yourself another job.

697
50:03.294 --> 50:05.092
That's enough!

698
50:05.092 --> 50:06.804
Oh, sir...

699
50:06.804 --> 50:08.232
Team Leader Yeo.

700
50:08.232 --> 50:09.695
She's new.

701
50:09.695 --> 50:12.019
People make mistakes.

702
50:12.019 --> 50:13.664
But, sir...

703
50:13.664 --> 50:15.364
Team Leader Yeo!

704
50:15.364 --> 50:17.215
You never messed up as a rookie?

705
50:17.215 --> 50:21.412
Why bring up ancient history?

706
50:21.412 --> 50:24.498
Don't take it too hard.

707
50:24.498 --> 50:26.334
Thank you.

708
50:26.334 --> 50:28.120
You're a pretty girl.

709
50:28.120 --> 50:29.785
Maybe...

710
50:29.785 --> 50:33.911
you should try hosting on home shopping.

711
50:33.911 --> 50:37.625
What a sleazy bastard!

712
50:45.205 --> 50:46.279
Oh, my...

713
50:47.272 --> 50:49.607
My father always told me

714
50:49.607 --> 50:53.598
everyone has to earn their keep.

715
50:53.598 --> 50:55.363
And another thing!

716
50:55.363 --> 50:57.156
When you meet a scumbag,

717
50:57.156 --> 50:59.033
you teach him a lesson

718
50:59.033 --> 51:01.743
so he never does it again!

719
51:03.029 --> 51:05.326
Who the hell are you?

720
51:05.326 --> 51:06.874
Are you insane?

721
51:06.874 --> 51:10.556
You grabbed my butt first, you bastard!

722
51:12.116 --> 51:14.073
You saw that, right?

723
51:14.073 --> 51:16.181
Well... No!

724
51:16.181 --> 51:19.011
I didn't see anything!

725
51:19.011 --> 51:21.651
Wow, I almost bought that.

726
51:41.993 --> 51:43.285
[Yeo Si Hyeon, Team Leader] Lee Eun Chae.

727
51:43.285 --> 51:45.871
He's pressing assault charges.

728
51:45.871 --> 51:50.251
He'll settle for ten million won. Wouldn't that be easier?

729
52:02.506 --> 52:05.015
Tell him I'll countersue.

730
52:05.015 --> 52:07.012
Team Leader Yeo.

731
52:07.550 --> 52:09.353
You should be ashamed of yourself.

732
52:09.353 --> 52:11.832
What? Watch your mouth!

733
52:19.181 --> 52:21.208
[Attorney Kim Se Hoon's Office] [Certified Labor Consultant's Office]

734
52:23.909 --> 52:26.251
No cameras, no witnesses.

735
52:26.251 --> 52:27.788
You're at a serious disadvantage.

736
52:27.788 --> 52:30.708
If you lose, you'll also pay their legal fees.

737
52:30.708 --> 52:32.749
Still want to fight?

738
52:33.419 --> 52:34.948
Hey.

739
52:34.948 --> 52:37.585
Think of it as stepping in crap.

740
52:39.633 --> 52:42.098
I didn't just step in it.

741
52:42.098 --> 52:44.930
Someone shoved me down right into the pile.

742
52:44.930 --> 52:46.979
Nice punch, though.

743
52:46.979 --> 52:52.032
I'll take a heroine who fights back over a helpless K-drama lead.

744
52:52.032 --> 52:53.171
Right?

745
52:53.171 --> 52:55.024
Yeah, me too.

746
52:55.024 --> 52:59.042
Except in real life, I'm getting sued for assault.

747
52:59.042 --> 53:00.090
What?

748
53:00.090 --> 53:01.238
He's the one at fault.

749
53:01.238 --> 53:02.663
And he's suing you?

750
53:02.663 --> 53:06.414
If I can't find ten million won and Dad will find out.

751
53:06.414 --> 53:08.989
What am I going to do?

752
53:09.602 --> 53:11.133
"Ten million won?"

753
53:11.133 --> 53:13.501
Shouldn't you tell your father?

754
53:13.501 --> 53:15.421
No way.

755
53:15.421 --> 53:17.293
I've already lied about my job.

756
53:17.293 --> 53:19.611
If he finds out I was sexually harassed,

757
53:19.611 --> 53:21.286
he'll hunt that manager down

758
53:21.286 --> 53:24.361
and rip every hair out of his head.

759
53:24.361 --> 53:26.597
Could you ask your brother-in-law for help?

760
53:26.597 --> 53:29.503
He lives on an allowance from my sister.

761
53:30.309 --> 53:31.923
Then...

762
53:32.436 --> 53:34.319
Let's pool our money.

763
53:41.951 --> 53:42.982
Forget it.

764
53:42.982 --> 53:45.982
You guys don't have any money.

765
53:45.982 --> 53:47.437
Okay!

766
53:48.911 --> 53:51.277
Let's bring the house down tonight

767
53:53.332 --> 53:54.959
and sell every last CD.

768
53:54.959 --> 53:56.168
Come on, huddle up!

769
53:56.168 --> 53:57.269
- We can do this. - Hands in!

770
53:57.269 --> 53:58.854
- Let's go! - India!

771
53:58.854 --> 54:00.508
- Red! - Red!

772
54:00.508 --> 54:02.716
Shouldn't our hands go down?

773
54:02.716 --> 54:03.764
Let's do this.

774
54:37.839 --> 54:39.492
Eun Chae!

775
54:40.004 --> 54:41.630
We sold all our CDs!

776
54:41.630 --> 54:43.202
No way.

777
54:43.202 --> 54:44.216
I'm serious!

778
54:44.216 --> 54:45.743
Hey, Eun Chae.

779
54:45.743 --> 54:47.383
We can do this.

780
54:47.383 --> 54:49.597
At this rate, we can cover the settlement.

781
54:49.597 --> 54:50.931
Well, except...

782
54:50.931 --> 54:52.591
We still need to sell 900 more.

783
54:52.591 --> 54:55.812
A real superfan! He bought every CD at once.

784
54:55.812 --> 54:57.810
Wait, seriously?

785
54:58.368 --> 54:59.989
Just a second.

786
54:59.989 --> 55:03.275
The customer wants a photo with us, I invited him.

787
55:03.275 --> 55:04.368
- Is that okay? - Yeah.

788
55:04.368 --> 55:06.280
Thank God I didn't take my makeup off.

789
55:06.280 --> 55:07.768
Good.

790
55:10.098 --> 55:12.025
Come on in.

791
55:13.829 --> 55:15.845
Could we take a picture?

792
55:15.845 --> 55:16.897
Two, three!

793
55:16.897 --> 55:19.027
- Thank you! - Thank you!

794
55:19.027 --> 55:21.005
Oh, I'm just the messenger.

795
55:21.005 --> 55:23.880
The person who bought them is...

796
55:31.255 --> 55:32.725
He is...

797
55:36.163 --> 55:37.186
He's that...

798
55:37.186 --> 55:39.690
sex addict...

799
55:49.638 --> 55:51.992
If this is about meeting Soo,

800
55:51.992 --> 55:53.619
I'll give you your money back.

801
55:53.619 --> 55:55.454
No, please.

802
55:55.454 --> 55:57.623
I think we had a misunderstanding,

803
55:57.623 --> 56:00.323
so I came to apologize.

804
56:09.259 --> 56:11.225
I'm sorry.

805
56:12.443 --> 56:15.743
I'll keep rooting for you.

806
56:22.191 --> 56:25.864
I heard you're friends with Lee Eun Chae.

807
56:26.860 --> 56:28.821
Give her a message for me.

808
56:28.821 --> 56:30.389
I'm going to...

809
56:30.389 --> 56:33.169
sue Seo Jin Woo.

810
56:59.093 --> 57:00.102
Don't fight.

811
57:00.102 --> 57:01.395
Three months, starting now.

812
57:01.395 --> 57:02.642
Come work as my secretary.

813
57:02.642 --> 57:05.802
I'm sure you'll fall for me too.

814
57:05.802 --> 57:07.750
Five degrees warmer.

815
57:07.750 --> 57:11.028
Leaving without my permission is a breach of contract.

816
57:11.028 --> 57:11.905
The penalty is...

817
57:11.905 --> 57:13.001
Three times?

818
57:13.001 --> 57:15.576
What kind of devil is this guy?

819
57:15.576 --> 57:16.702
Already smitten?

820
57:16.702 --> 57:18.426
Don't panic, Eun Chae.

821
57:18.426 --> 57:19.371
I'll be there!

822
57:19.371 --> 57:20.581
No matter what.

823
57:20.581 --> 57:22.750
You're quite the habitual liar.

824
57:22.750 --> 57:24.793
Is he watching something dirty?

825
57:24.793 --> 57:26.906
Why is my heart pounding?
